non-admin who browses to it sees a fully populated fake user list, and clicking Grant/Revoke VIP appears  
to succeed even though no backend mutation happened. Surface real errors for admin actions instead of     
faking success (the mock fallback is fine for read-only browsing/demo mode, but not for a PATCH that      
changes VIP status).                                                                                      
                                                                                                          
